</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/893e5570-7ec9-11f1-ab90-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/mike-maignan.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/893e5570-7ec9-11f1-ab90-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/mike-maignan.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">35685f0e-7ebf-11f1-b200-5581fa219da1</guid><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 14:53:35 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/893e5570-7ec9-11f1-ab90-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/mike-maignan.jpg">AFP - JEWEL SAMAD</source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>Spain braced to face France's firepower in World Cup semi-final</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260712-final-before-final-france-face-spain-in-world-cup-blockbuster</link><description>
